OL,3,GNEWSASkills, housing and AI boost in
OL,4,Aeconomy wish list
OL,5,
OL,6,FQuicker political decision-making,
OL,7,Fimprovements to recruitment, and
OL,8,Fup-skilling of staff are needed to
OL,9,Fboost an island's economy, business
OL,10,Fleaders have said.
OL,12,FA report by the Institute of Directors
OL,13,FGuernsey, with a 10-point plan, was
OL,14,Freleased on Wednesday, and also
OL,15,Fhighlighted the need to boost housing
OL,16,Fand AI innovation.
OL,18,FIt found government inaction and no
OL,19,F"shared vision and a direction that
OL,20,Fsurvives political terms" were the
OL,21,Fbiggest barriers to growth.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
